{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16079","headline":"早秋过龙武李将军书斋 · 王建","name":"早秋过龙武李将军书斋","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"高树蝉声秋巷里，朱门冷静似闲居。\n重装墨画数茎竹，长着香薰一架书。\n语笑侍儿知礼数，吟哦野客任狂疎。\n就中爱读英雄传，欲立功勳恐不如。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16079.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16079","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}